  "abstract_summary": "Clothing classification is an important task in computer vision. It has key uses in fashion retail, inventory management, and recommendation systems. This paper presents a deep learning framework for clothing classification. It compares Vision Transformer (ViT), EfficientNet, and Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)....",
